          "text": "Témoignages: [A432] de L'ISLE D'ABEAU (38) vers PARCIEUX (01) 25.04.2024",
          "text_sha256": "f9a663c8cd80c1bf0df7524bb47811aede608d95a1ceb9ce3ec26d0e25bf4fa1"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
